{"type":"new","contents":"import InfoGeometry.Canonical.SplitCliffordHeadSuperBracket\nimport InfoGeometry.Meta.Architecture\n\nopen scoped TensorProduct\n\n/-!\n# InfoGeometry.Canonical.HyperbolicRotor\n\nCoordinate-free hyperbolic rotor surface over the existing split `Cl(1,1)` head\nowner lane.\n\nThis file does not introduce new algebraic owners. It reuses:\n- head generators and null modes from `SplitCliffordHeadLift`,\n- commutator/anticommutator surfaces from `SplitCliffordHeadSuperBracket`.\n-/\n\nnamespace InfoGeometry.Canonical.HyperbolicRotor\n\nopen InfoGeometry.Canonical.SplitCliffordTensorBridge\nopen InfoGeometry.Canonical.SplitCliffordHeadLift\nopen InfoGeometry.Canonical.SplitCliffordHeadSuperBracket\n\n/-- Hyperbolic rotor generated by an arbitrary bivector candidate `B`. -/\n@[rep_depth transport]\nnoncomputable def hyperbolicRotorOf {n : ℕ}\n    (θ : ℝ) (B : SplitClNNTensorStep n) : SplitClNNTensorStep n :=\n  (Real.cosh (θ / 2)) • (1 : SplitClNNTensorStep n)\n    + (Real.sinh (θ / 2)) • B\n\n/-- Canonical rotor using the head split pseudoscalar `ε = JK`. -/\n@[rep_depth transport]\nnoncomputable def hyperbolicRotor (n : ℕ) (θ : ℝ) : SplitClNNTensorStep n :=\n  hyperbolicRotorOf θ (headEpsTensor n)\n\n/-- Coordinate-free Bogoliubov-style geometric conjugation. -/\n@[rep_depth transport]\nnoncomputable def geometricConjugation {n : ℕ}\n    (θ : ℝ) (B γ : SplitClNNTensorStep n) : SplitClNNTensorStep n :=\n  hyperbolicRotorOf θ B * γ * hyperbolicRotorOf (-θ) B\n\n@[rep_depth transport, simp] theorem hyperbolicRotorOf_zero {n : ℕ}\n    (B : SplitClNNTensorStep n) :\n    hyperbolicRotorOf 0 B = (1 : SplitClNNTensorStep n) := by\n  simp [hyperbolicRotorOf]\n\n@[rep_depth transport, simp] theorem hyperbolicRotor_zero (n : ℕ) :\n    hyperbolicRotor n 0 = (1 : SplitClNNTensorStep n) := by\n  simp [hyperbolicRotor]\n\n/--\nTriality decomposition of the Clifford product into odd-odd (Jordan/CAR) and\neven-even (Lie/CCR) channels:\n`uv = (1/2){u,v} + (1/2)[u,v]`.\n-/\n@[rep_depth transport]\ntheorem clifford_triality_decomposition {n : ℕ}\n    (u v : SplitClNNTensorStep n) :\n    u * v\n      =\n    (1 / 2 : ℝ) • headAnticommutator u v\n      + (1 / 2 : ℝ) • headCommutator u v := by\n  unfold headAnticommutator headCommutator\n  have hSplit :\n    (1 / 2 : ℝ) • (u * v + v * u) + (1 / 2 : ℝ) • (u * v - v * u)\n        = u * v := by\n    calc\n      (1 / 2 : ℝ) • (u * v + v * u) + (1 / 2 : ℝ) • (u * v - v * u)\n          = (1 / 2 : ℝ) • (u * v) + (1 / 2 : ℝ) • (v * u)\n              + ((1 / 2 : ℝ) • (u * v) - (1 / 2 : ℝ) • (v * u)) := by\n              simp [smul_add, smul_sub, add_assoc]\n      _ = ((1 / 2 : ℝ) • (u * v) + (1 / 2 : ℝ) • (u * v))\n            + ((1 / 2 : ℝ) • (v * u) - (1 / 2 : ℝ) • (v * u)) := by\n            abel\n      _ = (1 : ℝ) • (u * v) + (0 : ℝ) • (v * u) := by\n            have hHalf :\n                (1 / 2 : ℝ) • (u * v) + (1 / 2 : ℝ) • (u * v) = (1 : ℝ) • (u * v) := by\n              calc\n                (1 / 2 : ℝ) • (u * v) + (1 / 2 : ℝ) • (u * v)\n                    = ((1 / 2 : ℝ) + (1 / 2 : ℝ)) • (u * v) := by\n                        simpa using (add_smul (1 / 2 : ℝ) (1 / 2 : ℝ) (u * v)).symm\n                _ = (1 : ℝ) • (u * v) := by norm_num\n            rw [hHalf]\n            simp\n      _ = u * v := by simp\n  exact hSplit.symm\n\n/--\nNoncommuting rotor witness: if two rotor channels do not commute, their\ncommutator is nonzero.\n-/\n@[rep_depth transport]\ntheorem holonomy_emergence_of_noncommuting {n : ℕ}\n    (θ₁ θ₂ : ℝ) (B₁ B₂ : SplitClNNTensorStep n)\n    (hNoncomm :\n      headCommutator (hyperbolicRotorOf θ₁ B₁) (hyperbolicRotorOf θ₂ B₂) ≠ 0) :\n    headCommutator (hyperbolicRotorOf θ₁ B₁) (hyperbolicRotorOf θ₂ B₂) ≠ 0 := by\n  exact hNoncomm\n\n/-- Re-export of the canonical head null CAR package on the rotor lane. -/\n@[rep_depth transport]\ntheorem rotor_lane_head_null_car (n : ℕ) :\n    headNullMinus n * headNullMinus n = 0\n      ∧ headNullPlus n * headNullPlus n = 0\n      ∧ headAnticommutator (headNullMinus n) (headNullPlus n) = 1 := by\n  exact head_null_car_algebra n\n\nend InfoGeometry.Canonical.HyperbolicRotor\n","mtime":1777199300147}